=A paid order is ready to pick and pack.

Order: {{ $('Validate and build the packing slip').item.json.orderNumber }}
Units: {{ $('Validate and build the packing slip').item.json.totalItems }}
Ship to: {{ $('Validate and build the packing slip').item.json.shipTo.name }}
Carrier: {{ $('Validate and build the packing slip').item.json.carrier || 'Not assigned' }}
Tracking: {{ $('Validate and build the packing slip').item.json.trackingNumber || 'Not assigned' }}

The attached packing slip contains SKUs, descriptions, and quantities only—no prices. Pick against the SKUs and verify every quantity before dispatch.
